### Stripe Development/Testing Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### Note: These endpoints are only available in development mode

### Setup Main Account (Add External Accounts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/setup-main-account

### Create Test Payout from Main Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/test-payout?amount=100&currency=usd

### Get Test Account Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/test-account

### Set Connected Account ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/set-connected-account?account_id={{connectedAccountId}}

### Get Connected Account Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/connected-account

### Check Currency Support
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/check-currency-support?currency=usd

### Get Main Account Info and External Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/main-account-info

### Create Connected Account (Express)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/create-connected-account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "country": "US",
  "business_type": "individual"
}

### Attach Test Bank Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/attach-test-bank
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": "{{connectedAccountId}}",
  "routing_number": "110000000",
  "account_number": "000123456789",
  "currency": "usd",
  "holder_name": "Jenny Rosen",
  "holder_type": "individual",
  "country": "US"
}

### Fund Connected Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/fund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": "{{connectedAccountId}}",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "usd",
  "description": "Test funding"
}

### Create Payout from Connected Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/payout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": "{{connectedAccountId}}",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "usd",
  "method": "standard"
}

### List External Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/external-accounts?account_id={{connectedAccountId}}

### Get Account Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stripe/dev/balance?account_id={{connectedAccountId}}

### Variables (set these in your environment or replace manually):
# @connectedAccountId = acct_1234567890
